        }
      }
    },
    "Lead usually comes from your plumbing, not the ground: old pipes, lead solder, and brass fittings or well parts. It varies from house to house." : {

    },
    "Lead usually dissolves from plumbing, so even a neighbor's test can't tell you about your home." : {

