    },
    "While auditing the public data, we found three columns where the lab's reporting limit is above the state standard (silver, cadmium and chromium), which makes almost every test look contaminated. We excluded them. The tract file's manganese health-limit column also duplicates the 50 ppb column, so %@ uses the 50 ppb NC standard." : {

    },
    "While auditing the public data, we found three columns where the lab's reporting limit is above the state standard (silver, cadmium and chromium), which makes almost every test look contaminated. We excluded them. The tract file's manganese health-limit column also duplicates the 50 ppb column, so AquaShield uses the 50 ppb NC standard." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Al revisar los datos públicos, encontramos tres columnas en las que el límite de notificación del laboratorio está por encima de la norma estatal (plata, cadmio y cromo), lo que hace que casi todos los análisis parezcan contaminados. Las excluimos. Además, la columna del límite de salud para el manganeso del archivo de sectores censales duplica la columna de 50 ppb, por lo que AquaShield usa la norma de NC de 50 ppb."
          }
        }
      }
    },
